    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-4xl">SPF Record: The Complete Guide</h1>
    <div class="pd-answer" data-vs="answer">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-dim">
      SPF (Sender Policy Framework) is a TXT record that answers: <strong class="text-ink">which mail
      servers are allowed to send email as my domain?</strong> Receivers check it on every message;
      fail it and your mail goes to spam, or bounces.
    </p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="font-display mt-10 text-xl font-semibold text-ink">SPF mechanism lookup cost matrix</h2>
    <section class="not-prose my-4" aria-label="Reference table">
      <div class="glass rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-lg sm:p-7 overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="pdns-table" style="width:100%">
          <thead><tr><th>Mechanism</th><th>Syntax example</th><th>DNS lookups consumed</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody><tr><td class="font-medium text-ink">include</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">include:_spf.google.com</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">1 (plus nested includes)</td></tr><tr><td class="font-medium text-ink">a</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">a:mail.example.com</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">1</td></tr><tr><td class="font-medium text-ink">mx</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">mx:example.com</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">1 (plus A lookups of each MX)</td></tr><tr><td class="font-medium text-ink">ptr</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">ptr:example.com</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">1 (deprecated, avoid)</td></tr><tr><td class="font-medium text-ink">exists</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">exists:verify.example.com</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">1</td></tr><tr><td class="font-medium text-ink">redirect</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">redirect=example.com</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">1 (replaces the record)</td></tr><tr><td class="font-medium text-ink">ip4 / ip6</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">ip4:192.0.2.0/24</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">0</td></tr><tr><td class="font-medium text-ink">all</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">~all or -all</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">0</td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <h2 class="font-display mt-10 text-xl font-semibold text-ink">The 7 SPF evaluation results (RFC 7208 section 2.6)</h2>
    <section class="not-prose my-4" aria-label="Reference table">
      <div class="glass rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-lg sm:p-7 overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="pdns-table" style="width:100%">
          <thead><tr><th>Result</th><th>Meaning</th><th>Typical receiver action</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody><tr><td class="font-medium text-ink">Pass</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">IP is authorized by the record</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">Accept toward DMARC alignment</td></tr><tr><td class="font-medium text-ink">Fail (-all)</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">IP is explicitly not authorized</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">Reject, or mark per policy</td></tr><tr><td class="font-medium text-ink">SoftFail (~all)</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">IP is probably not authorized</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">Accept but flag as suspicious</td></tr><tr><td class="font-medium text-ink">Neutral (?)</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">Record asserts nothing about the IP</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">Treat like no SPF</td></tr><tr><td class="font-medium text-ink">None</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">No SPF record published</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">No SPF evaluation possible</td></tr><tr><td class="font-medium text-ink">TempError</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">DNS timeout or SERVFAIL during evaluation</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">Accept and retry later (transient)</td></tr><tr><td class="font-medium text-ink">PermError</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">Record is malformed or exceeds limits</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">Permanent evaluation failure</td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <h2 class="font-display mt-10 text-xl font-semibold text-ink">SPF mechanism lookup cost matrix</h2>
    <section class="not-prose my-4" aria-label="Reference table">
      <div class="glass rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-lg sm:p-7 overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="pdns-table" style="width:100%">
          <thead><tr><th>Mechanism</th><th>Syntax example</th><th>DNS lookups consumed</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody><tr><td class="font-medium text-ink">include</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">include:_spf.google.com</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">1 (plus nested includes)</td></tr><tr><td class="font-medium text-ink">a</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">a:mail.example.com</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">1</td></tr><tr><td class="font-medium text-ink">mx</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">mx:example.com</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">1 (plus A lookups of each MX)</td></tr><tr><td class="font-medium text-ink">ptr</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">ptr:example.com</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">1 (deprecated, avoid)</td></tr><tr><td class="font-medium text-ink">exists</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">exists:verify.example.com</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">1</td></tr><tr><td class="font-medium text-ink">redirect</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">redirect=example.com</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">1 (replaces the record)</td></tr><tr><td class="font-medium text-ink">ip4 / ip6</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">ip4:192.0.2.0/24</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">0</td></tr><tr><td class="font-medium text-ink">all</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">~all or -all</td><td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">0</td></tr></tbody>
